  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/636/armor-stand-arms-header.png\" width=\"1857\" height=\"140\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>描述</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">现在，你可以轻松快速地为所有盔甲架添加手臂，进一步提升你的原版游戏体验。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只需靠近你已经放置的盔甲架，使用命令 <em><strong>/trigger armorstandarms</strong></em>&nbsp;，它就会为你生成手臂。&nbsp; 确保你距离盔甲架不超过3个方块的距离。&nbsp; <em>此功能在服务器端运行，客户端无需安装即可在服务器上使用。</em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/637/armor-stand-arms-screenshot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"><br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即获取服务器，与朋友一起玩耍！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a> 或下方横幅，并使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享受25%折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
